Provides: python3-cc-token-saver-mcp
Replaces: python3-cc-token-saver-mcp (<< 1.0.0-2~)
Breaks: python3-cc-token-saver-mcp (<< 1.0.0-2~)
Description: MCP server that delegates tasks to a local LLM to save Claude Code tokens
 Reduce your Claude Code tokens with CC Token Saver MCP server that
 intelligently delegates simple tasks to your local LLM while keeping
 Claude Code for complex coordination and architecture decisions.
 .
 The MCP server exposes your local LLM as tools that Claude Code can use for
 code snippet generation, simple refactoring tasks, documentation writing,
 code reviews, and basic Q&A.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-cc-token-saver
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.5.1),
 cc-token-saver-mcp (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers CC Token Saver MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for cc-token-saver-mcp. Installing it registers the
 cc-token-saver-mcp binary as an available MCP server in the local
 mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
